  "translation": "Na nau, plis, king, bikman bilong mi, harim ⟨את⟩ ol tok bilong wokman bilong yu. Sapos Yahwe i wokim yu long pairap long mi, orait, em i ken smelim minkha; tasol sapos ol manmeri, orait ol i krosim long Yahwe, bilong wanem, ol i rausim mi long tede, na mi no inap join long graun bilong Yahwe, ol i tok: Go, wokim long ol narapela Elohim.",
